      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "I hope this finds you all well with hopeful outlook. . I want to thank you for your kindness recently received - the writing materials, etc and especially the very nice little \"Storm of St. Therese's Glory\". I surely find it very interest- ing. This favor came Monday - day before-yesterday. Many thanks too for the beautiful boquet just came in this afternoon. God bless you. May He speed up your plans and perfect undertakings!",
